# One call site in a generic body, two instantiations: each emitted instance must call
# its own callee, and both callees must be emitted.
#
# Written from the intended semantics (2026-10-02), NOT from today's output: today the
# deferred re-pointing leaves only the last resolution on the shared node, so one of the
# two `wrap_*` calls the other's `pick_*` and its own `pick_*` is never emitted.
require wrap_i32
require wrap_meter
require pick_i32
require pick_meter
call wrap_i32 pick_i32
call wrap_meter pick_meter
